{
  "section": "indicators",
  "available_sections": [
    {
      "id": "core",
      "description": "Required Python/signal rules and revision lifecycle."
    },
    {
      "id": "research",
      "description": "Required research choices, defaults and explicit inheritance."
    },
    {
      "id": "evidence",
      "description": "Parameter proposals, source claims and saved trading formulas."
    },
    {
      "id": "indicators",
      "description": "Installed indicator catalog and selected API/source reference."
    },
    {
      "id": "example",
      "description": "Complete Python and YAML example to adapt."
    },
    {
      "id": "configuration",
      "description": "Full execution YAML schema and metric settings."
    },
    {
      "id": "runtime",
      "description": "Generated isolation, resource policy and failure recovery."
    }
  ],
  "content": {
    "namespace": "tradingdev.domain.indicators",
    "module_contract": "Named technical indicators backed by TA-Lib.\n\nOutputs preserve the input index and use float64. Warm-up, initialization and\nmissing-value handling follow TA-Lib: leading NaNs delay the first observation,\nand an interior NaN may propagate through the remainder of an indicator. Values\nare never filled or computed using future observations. Infinite inputs are\nrejected. OHLC inputs must share the same index because TA-Lib works by position.",
    "catalog": [
      {
        "name": "adx",
        "signature": "adx(high: 'pd.Series', low: 'pd.Series', close: 'pd.Series', length: 'int' = 14) -> 'ADXResult'",
        "summary": "Wilder ADX and ``+DI``/``-DI`` with their respective TA-Lib warm-ups."
      },
      {
        "name": "atr",
        "signature": "atr(high: 'pd.Series', low: 'pd.Series', close: 'pd.Series', length: 'int' = 14) -> 'pd.Series'",
        "summary": "Wilder ATR; the first ``length`` values are NaN, including the first bar."
      },
      {
        "name": "bollinger_bands",
        "signature": "bollinger_bands(close: 'pd.Series', length: 'int' = 20, std: 'float' = 2.0) -> 'BollingerBands'",
        "summary": "SMA bands using population standard deviation (``ddof=0``)."
      },
      {
        "name": "ema",
        "signature": "ema(close: 'pd.Series', length: 'int') -> 'pd.Series'",
        "summary": "EMA seeded with the first ``length`` observations' simple average."
      },
      {
        "name": "macd",
        "signature": "macd(close: 'pd.Series', fast: 'int' = 12, slow: 'int' = 26, signal: 'int' = 9) -> 'MACDResult'",
        "summary": "TA-Lib MACD with all outputs warming up for ``slow + signal - 2`` bars."
      },
      {
        "name": "rsi",
        "signature": "rsi(close: 'pd.Series', length: 'int' = 14) -> 'pd.Series'",
        "summary": "Wilder RSI, first defined after ``length`` price changes."
      },
      {
        "name": "sma",
        "signature": "sma(close: 'pd.Series', length: 'int') -> 'pd.Series'",
        "summary": "Simple moving average; the first ``length - 1`` values are NaN."
      },
      {
        "name": "stochastic",
        "signature": "stochastic(high: 'pd.Series', low: 'pd.Series', close: 'pd.Series', k: 'int' = 14, d: 'int' = 3, smooth_k: 'int' = 3) -> 'StochasticResult'",
        "summary": "SMA-smoothed stochastic with a shared ``k + smooth_k + d - 3`` warm-up."
      }
    ],
    "selected": null
  }
}

{
  "section": "configuration",
  "available_sections": [
    {
      "id": "core",
      "description": "Required Python/signal rules and revision lifecycle."
    },
    {
      "id": "research",
      "description": "Required research choices, defaults and explicit inheritance."
    },
    {
      "id": "evidence",
      "description": "Parameter proposals, source claims and saved trading formulas."
    },
    {
      "id": "indicators",
      "description": "Installed indicator catalog and selected API/source reference."
    },
    {
      "id": "example",
      "description": "Complete Python and YAML example to adapt."
    },
    {
      "id": "configuration",
      "description": "Full execution YAML schema and metric settings."
    },
    {
      "id": "runtime",
      "description": "Generated isolation, resource policy and failure recovery."
    }
  ],
  "content": {
    "config_schema": {
      "$defs": {
        "AutomaticWalkForwardConfig": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "Rolling or expanding windows computed from the available row count.",
          "properties": {
            "target_metric": {
              "default": "sharpe_ratio",
              "description": "Fold log/summary metric; does not configure strategy training.",
              "title": "Target Metric",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "label_horizon": {
              "default": 0,
              "description": "Forward label bars; zero disables the fold leakage audit.",
              "minimum": 0,
              "title": "Label Horizon",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "mode": {
              "const": "automatic",
              "title": "Mode",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "n_splits": {
              "default": 1,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "N Splits",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "train_ratio": {
              "default": 0.8,
              "exclusiveMaximum": 1,
              "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
              "title": "Train Ratio",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "expanding": {
              "default": false,
              "title": "Expanding",
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "mode"
          ],
          "title": "AutomaticWalkForwardConfig",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "BacktestConfig": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "Backtest execution configuration.",
          "properties": {
            "symbol": {
              "title": "Symbol",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "timeframe": {
              "title": "Timeframe",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "start_date": {
              "format": "date-time",
              "title": "Start Date",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "end_date": {
              "format": "date-time",
              "title": "End Date",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "init_cash": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Init Cash"
            },
            "fees": {
              "default": 0.0006,
              "title": "Fees",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "slippage": {
              "default": 0.0005,
              "title": "Slippage",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "position_size": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Position Size"
            },
            "stop_loss": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Stop Loss"
            },
            "take_profit": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Take Profit"
            },
            "signal_as_position": {
              "default": false,
              "description": "Volume mode only: true makes signal=0 close an existing position; false retains it while preventing new entries. Signal mode always uses position states (1 long, -1 short, 0 flat) and ignores this flag. In both modes -1 selects short, not a sell-only exit.",
              "title": "Signal As Position",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "re_entry_after_sl": {
              "default": true,
              "title": "Re Entry After Sl",
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "mode": {
              "default": "signal",
              "enum": [
                "signal",
                "volume"
              ],
              "title": "Mode",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "monthly_max_loss": {
              "default": 1500.0,
              "description": "Volume mode only; requires timestamps. Quote-currency loss limit for each UTC calendar month. Compare cumulative P&L equity with the previous observed month's last close equity (zero in the first month). Missing months are not filled; gaps belong to the next observed month. Count current-month costs and unrealised P&L changes, not prior-month P&L or entry costs again. Trade records retain whole-trade P&L and costs. Check after stop exits before re-entry and after ordinary trading at close. Reaching the loss limit closes any remaining position at close and pauses until the next observed month; exit costs may exceed the limit.",
              "title": "Monthly Max Loss",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "periods_per_year": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Periods Per Year"
            },
            "risk_free_rate": {
              "default": 0.0,
              "exclusiveMinimum": -1,
              "title": "Risk Free Rate",
              "type": "number"
            },
            "required_return": {
              "default": 0.0,
              "exclusiveMinimum": -1,
              "title": "Required Return",
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "symbol",
            "timeframe",
            "start_date",
            "end_date"
          ],
          "title": "BacktestConfig",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "ExplicitWalkForwardConfig": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "One training/test pair, with inclusive nonoverlapping UTC calendar days.",
          "properties": {
            "target_metric": {
              "default": "sharpe_ratio",
              "description": "Fold log/summary metric; does not configure strategy training.",
              "title": "Target Metric",
